---
description: Releases, Homebrew, update checks and quality gate with shipcrate
globs: release.conf, scripts/release.sh, scripts/check.sh
alwaysApply: false
---
Use shipcrate (see AGENTS.md and skills/shipcrate/SKILL.md) for release setup and releases.
- Ask before creating repos/taps, pushing, tagging or publishing.
- Never put tokens in files; use `gh auth login` and `${{ github.token }}`.
- Run `sh scripts/check.sh --release` before releasing. Preview with `--dry-run`.
